     A** WCMC MEDICAL SERVICE STATUS TABLE FILE
     A**
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PSS01                     TEXT('MED SVC STATUS TABLE FILE')
     A            SSCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            SSKEY     R               REFFLD(KEY)
     A                                      COLHDG('MED SVC' 'STS 2-A')
     A            SSTYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG) COLHDG('CODE' 'TYPE')
     A***                                     Valid Values:
     A***                                        O = Open
     A***                                        C = Closed
     A            SSDESC    R               REFFLD(DS60)
     A            SSSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A                                      COLHDG('RCD' 'STS')
     A            SSUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'USER')
     A            SSPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'PGM')
     A            SSTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TIME')
     A            SSDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'DATE')
     A            SSIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            SSIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A            SSITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
